<title>UK: Egypt to buy 150,000 tonnes gas oil Jan-March.</title>
<headline>Egypt to buy 150,000 tonnes gas oil Jan-March.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt has tendered to buy up to 150,000 tonnes of 0.5 percent sulphur gas oil for delivery in January to March next year, traders said.</p>
<p>The tender calls for two cargoes, plus an optional cargo, of 25-30,000 tonnes for delivery into Suez and two cargoes, plus one optional cargo, of 25,000 tonnes into Alexandria.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
